## Why This Is Asked

This angle tests rapid diagnostics, dependency backoffs, and rollback discipline under real traffic.

## Key Concepts

- Observability and tracing across config fetches
- Backoff, timeouts, and cache strategies
- Feature flags and safe rollback
- Incident communication under pressure

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo example of config fetch with exponential backoff
async function fetchConfig() {
  let attempt = 0;
  const max = 5;
  let delay = 100;
  while (attempt < max) {
    try { return await configService.get(); } catch (e) { await sleep(delay); delay *= 2; attempt++; }
  }
  throw new Error("config fetch failed");
}
```

